0%E6%96%AF%E5%9D%A6%E7%8E%AF%E7%A3%81%E6%9C%BA%22%2C%22num%22%3A100%2C%22url%22%3A%22%2Fbh3%2Fwiki%2Fcontent%2F1274%2Fdetail%22%7D%2C%7B%22name%22%3A%22%E8%B6%85%E5%AF%BC%E9%87%91%E5%B1%9E%E6%B0%A2%22%2C%22num%22%3A50%2C%22url%22%3A%22%2Fbh3%2Fwiki%2Fcontent%2F1140%2Fdetail%22%7D%2C%7B%22name%22%3A%22%E6%B5%81%E4%BD%93%E5%90%88%E9%87%91%E5%9D%97%22%2C%22num%22%3A4%2C%22url%22%3A%22%2Fbh3%2Fwiki%2Fcontent%2F1890%2Fdetail%22%7D%5D%7D%7D%5D\" data-ts=\"1753123945176\" data-col-type=\"l2r1\"><div style=\"order: 0;\"> <div data-part=\"info\" data-tmpl=\"weapon\" class=\"obc-tmpl__part obc-tmpl-weapon obc-tmpl__part--info obc-tmpl__part--align-banner\"><h1>武器数据</h1> <table class=\"obc-tmpl__gain-method obc-tmpl-weapon__info-table\"><colgroup><col> <col> <col></colgroup> <tbody><tr><td rowspan=\"3\" class=\"obc-tmpl-weapon__info-avatar\"><img src=\"https://uploadstatic.mihoyo.com/bh3-wiki/2021/10/27/6100274/630f32b2d8da1cffa01dd1d347caf76d_120116189514386447.png\" alt=\"\"></td> <td class=\"h3\">星级</td> <td colspan=\"5\"><div class=\"obc-tmpl-weapon__info-stars\"><i class=\"obc-tmpl__rate-icon\"></i><i class=\"obc-tmpl__rate-icon\"></i><i class=\"obc-tmpl__rate-icon\"></i><i class=\"obc-tmpl__rate-icon\"></i><i class=\"obc-tmpl__rate-icon\"></i><i class=\"obc-tmpl__rate-icon\"></i></div></td></tr> <tr><td class=\"h3\">攻击</td> <td colspan=\"5\" class=\"obc-tmpl__rich-text\">430</td></tr><tr><td class=\"h3\">会心</td> <td colspan=\"5\" class=\"obc-tmpl__rich-text\">27</td></tr></tbody></table> <div class=\"obc-tmpl-weapon__info-desc\"><p style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\">至暗的「黑渊」执掌凋零与死亡，圣洁的「白花」绽放创生与复苏。创生的过程必需要凋零作为前提。黑与白，或许从不是不可相容的两面；生与死，也许一开始就源自同一条河流。圣枪绽放，一切敌人将湮殁凋零，所有伤者皆安享治愈。</p></div> <!----></div></div><div style=\"order: 1;\"> <div data-part=\"skill\" data-tmpl=\"weapon\" class=\"obc-tmpl__part obc-tmpl-weapon obc-tmpl__part--skill obc-tmpl__part--align-banner\"><h2>武器技能</h2> <table class=\"obc-tmpl__gain-method\"><colgroup><col> <col></colgroup> <tbody><tr><td class=\"h3\">初蕾</td> <td colspan=\"5\" class=\"obc-tmpl__rich-text\"><p style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\">[能量消耗:0][冷却:25秒]使用武器技能【初蕾】造成200%+700.0%攻击力的物理伤害，回复15点能量和200点生命。<br>在敌人特定招式期间，武器按钮闪光时，可无视所有条件发动反击投技，控制敌人并造成20%攻击力物理伤害+800.0%攻击力的物理伤害，不计入冷却时间；辉骑士·月魄使用时，爆发状态下武器技能变为特殊攻击【圣枪绽放】，造成200%+ 1,500.0%攻击力物理伤害，同时视为武器技和必杀技伤害，有30%的额外暴击率，技能结束时，还会额外追加4*10%攻击力物理伤害，主动技能期间角色触发时滞领域效果，角色、敌人身上的技能效果以及关卡都会停止计时，释放完后会主动退出爆发状态，进入和退出爆发状态均会重置武器技能冷却时间。</p></td></tr><tr><td class=\"h3\">生灭逆流</td> <td colspan=\"5\" class=\"obc-tmpl__rich-text\"><p style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\">暴击率提高25.0%;爆发状态期间，物理伤害提高35%，持续15秒，极限闪避技能发动时，极限闪避技能冷却时间降低2秒，且下一次【圣枪绽放】额外造成800.0%攻击力的物理伤害，最多可叠加2次</p></td></tr><tr><td class=\"h3\">创生与凋零</td> <td colspan=\"5\" class=\"obc-tmpl__rich-text\"><p style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\">必杀技冷却时间降低20.0%。<br>爆发状态期间，暴击伤害提高20.0%，持续15秒。【圣枪绽放】动作过程中，未能击杀任何敌人，则下次[初蕾]倍率提高至200% + 1,200.0%。</p></td></tr><tr><td class=\"h3\">创生之键</td> <td colspan=\"5\" class=\"obc-tmpl__rich-text\"><p style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\">在联机Raid关卡中，角色的武器技能、分支攻击、蓄力攻击和必杀技的全伤害提升22.0%，角色使用武器主动技能后，每次造成伤害时回复1.5%最大生命值，持续6秒（该效果有1秒触发间隔）</p></td></tr></tbody></table> <!----></div></div><div style=\"order: 2;\"> <div data-part=\"forging\" data-tmpl=\"weapon\" class=\"obc-tmpl__part obc-tmpl-weapon obc-tmpl__part--forging obc-tmpl__part--align-banner\"><h2>悬赏锻造</h2> <table class=\"obc-tmpl__gain-method\"><colgroup><col> <col></colgroup> <tbody><tr><td class=\"h3\">超限素材</td> <td colspan=\"5\"><div class=\"forging-material-td\"><div class=\"obc-tmpl__icon-text-num\"><a target=\"_blank\" href=\"/bh3/wiki/content/146/detail\"><img src=\"https://uploadstatic.mihoyo.com/bh3-wiki/2021/10/22/91006211/3b334001f668dbaf624355cade77dca1_3385298348386340557.png\" alt=\"\" class=\"obc-tmpl__icon\"><span class=\"obc-tmpl__icon-text\">解锁「黑渊白花」图鉴（经过调律），锻造武器获得</span></a> <span class=\"obc-tmpl__icon-num\">*1</span></div></div></td></tr> <tr><td class=\"h3\">其他素材</td> <td colspan=\"5\"><div class=\"forging-other-material-td\"><div class=\"obc-tmpl__icon-text-n