3%BD%E5%8F%AF%E4%BB%A5%E5%8F%A0%E5%8A%A0%E4%B8%8B%E4%B8%80%E6%AC%A1%E6%AD%A6%E5%99%A8%E4%B8%BB%E5%8A%A8%E6%8A%80%E8%83%BD%E7%9A%84%E4%BC%A4%E5%AE%B3%EF%BC%8C%E6%AD%A6%E5%99%A8%E4%B8%BB%E5%8A%A8%E6%8A%80%E8%83%BD%E5%85%BC%E5%85%B7sp%E5%9B%9E%E5%A4%8D%E5%92%8C%E8%B6%85%E9%AB%98%E5%80%8D%E7%8E%87%E4%BC%A4%E5%AE%B3%EF%BC%8C%E5%90%8C%E6%97%B6%E7%88%86%E5%8F%91%E7%8A%B6%E6%80%81%E4%B8%8B%E7%9A%84%E6%AD%A6%E5%99%A8%E6%8A%80%E8%83%BD%E9%99%84%E5%B8%A6%E6%97%B6%E5%81%9C%EF%BC%8C%E6%98%AF%E4%B8%BA%E8%BE%89%E9%AA%91%E5%A3%AB%C2%B7%E6%9C%88%E9%AD%84%E9%87%8F%E8%BA%AB%E6%89%93%E9%80%A0%E7%9A%84%E6%AD%A6%E5%99%A8%EF%BC%8C%E4%B8%BA%E8%AF%A5%E8%A7%92%E8%89%B2%E7%9A%84%E9%A6%96%E9%80%89%E6%AD%A6%E5%99%A8%EF%BC%8C%E5%85%B6%E4%BB%96%E9%AA%91%E6%9E%AA%E8%A7%92%E8%89%B2%E5%88%99%E4%B8%8E%E8%AF%A5%E6%AD%A6%E5%99%A8%E9%80%82%E9%85%8D%E6%80%A7%E8%BE%83%E5%B7%AE%E3%80%82%3C%2Fp%3E%22%7D%7D%5D\" data-ts=\"1753123973959\" data-col-type=\"l2r1\"><div style=\"order: 0;\"> <div data-part=\"role\" data-tmpl=\"weapon\" class=\"obc-tmpl__part obc-tmpl-weapon obc-tmpl__part--role obc-tmpl__part--align-banner\"><h2>适用角色</h2> <table class=\"obc-tmpl__gain-method obc-tmpl-weapon__role-table\"><colgroup><col> <col></colgroup> <tbody><tr><td class=\"h3\"><div class=\"role-icon-td\"><div><img src=\"https://uploadstatic.mihoyo.com/bh3-wiki/2021/11/02/73514954/d96a17d8d20b1ac8a547ae52396d9fdc_3564077600032899085.png\" alt=\"\"></div> <span>辉骑士·月魄</span></div></td> <td><div class=\"obc-tmpl-weapon__role-stars\"><span>推荐指数</span> <div><i class=\"obc-tmpl__rate-icon\"></i><i class=\"obc-tmpl__rate-icon\"></i><i class=\"obc-tmpl__rate-icon\"></i><i class=\"obc-tmpl__rate-icon\"></i><i class=\"obc-tmpl__rate-icon\"></i></div></div></td> <td colspan=\"3\" class=\"obc-tmpl__rich-text\"><p style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\">武器被动技能与月魄完美契合，主动技能提供不俗伤害的同时也加快了回转，直接改变了月魄的输出流程，提升极大。</p></td></tr><tr><td class=\"h3\"><div class=\"role-icon-td\"><div><img src=\"https://uploadstatic.mihoyo.com/bh3-wiki/2021/10/31/77124895/c8935048fddffe315c844aad2451251b_1489721517653312293.png\" alt=\"\"></div> <span>明日福音</span></div></td> <td><div class=\"obc-tmpl-weapon__role-stars\"><span>推荐指数</span> <div><i class=\"obc-tmpl__rate-icon\"></i><i class=\"obc-tmpl__rate-icon\"></i><i class=\"obc-tmpl__rate-icon\"></i><i class=\"obc-tmpl__rate-icon\"></i><i class=\"obc-tmpl__rate-icon obc-tmpl__rate-icon--inactive\"></i></div></div></td> <td colspan=\"3\" class=\"obc-tmpl__rich-text\"><p style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\">超限武器提供高额面板。虽无法触发【圣枪绽放】及相关技能，但主动技能释放速度快，且可提供能量回复。部分流程中表现良好</p></td></tr></tbody></table> <!----></div></div><div style=\"order: 1;\"> <div data-part=\"review\" data-tmpl=\"weapon\" class=\"obc-tmpl__part obc-tmpl-weapon obc-tmpl__part--review obc-tmpl__part--align-banner\"><h2>武器测评</h2> <div class=\"obc-tmpl-valkyrie__skill-container\"><div><img src=\"https://uploadstatic.mihoyo.com/bh3-wiki/2021/10/31/77124895/610fd35c4ff265198494043814c5abb0_6636390217891746795.gif\" class=\"mobile-gif\"></div> <div class=\"obc-tmpl-valkyrie__skill-item\"><div class=\"obc-tmpl-valkyrie__skill-item-desc\"><div class=\"text\"><p style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\">黑渊白花的超限形态，可无条件为角色提供高额暴击和必杀技的冷却降低，并在爆发状态下为角色提供物伤爆伤和极限闪避冷却时间减少，同时每次触发极限闪避都可以叠加下一次武器主动技能的伤害，武器主动技能兼具sp回复和超高倍率伤害，同时爆发状态下的武器技能附带时停，是为辉骑士·月魄量身打造的武器，为该角色的首选武器，其他骑枪角色则与该武器适配性较差。</p></div> <div class=\"obc-tmpl-valkyrie__skill-item-desc-gif\" style=\"padding: 0px;\"><img src=\"https://uploadstatic.mihoyo.com/bh3-wiki/2021/10/31/77124895/610fd35c4ff265198494043814c5abb0_6636390217891746795.gif\" alt=\"\"></div></div></div></div> <!----></div></div></div></div></div> <div data-v-f0365338=\"\" class=\"detail__body-endpart\"><hr data-v-f0365338=\"\"> <p data-v-f0365338=\"\" class=\"detail__copyright\"><img data-v-f0365338=\"\" src=\"data:image/png;base64,\">\n        词条内容由圣芙蕾雅档案馆编辑团队原创，禁止转载\n      </p></div> <!---->",
